1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:04,278
Every startup has two questions it can't answer cheaply.

2
00:00:04,278 --> 00:00:05,815
What are we worth?

3
00:00:05,815 --> 00:00:07,872
And who exactly owns us?

4
00:00:07,872 --> 00:00:10,932
BlockID Startup Passport answers both.

5
00:00:10,932 --> 00:00:12,494
Agents propose.

6
00:00:12,494 --> 00:00:13,929
Humans approve.

7
00:00:13,929 --> 00:00:15,411
Chains prove.

8
00:00:16,886 --> 00:00:23,982
Today, early valuations are slow, costly and unsourced, and shareholders can't verify what they own.

9
00:00:23,982 --> 00:00:29,789
With BlockID, a founder pastes a website and gets an evidence-cited valuation in minutes.

10
00:00:29,789 --> 00:00:39,242
After one human approval, they have KYC-gated shares on-chain, a cap table they can grow, and dividends they can pay, all verifiable by anyone.

11
00:00:40,702 --> 00:00:43,475
Here is the whole system on one slide.

12
00:00:43,475 --> 00:00:46,600
The founder gives a website and a shareholder list.

13
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:52,785
AI agents read up to six pages and run three searches, and a fixed formula computes the value.

14
00:00:52,785 --> 00:00:54,920
The agents hold no keys.

15
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:57,616
A human admin signs one approval.

16
00:00:57,616 --> 00:01:06,496
Only then does the isolated issuer, the only component with a key, create the register on our zero-gas chain and mirror it to Ethereum and HashKey.

17
00:01:06,496 --> 00:01:11,847
The proof: tokens in MetaMask, a verify page, and a public explorer.

18
00:01:13,326 --> 00:01:15,969
The AI only suggests scores.

19
00:01:15,969 --> 00:01:24,510
It reads the company's public site, finds competitors and analyses the market, and every figure must cite a fetched source, or it is dropped.

20
00:01:24,510 --> 00:01:30,539
A fixed, public formula then turns seven weighted dimensions into a grade and a valuation range.

21
00:01:30,539 --> 00:01:39,615
For Canva, it found nine real competitors, a cited annual revenue of six billion Australian dollars, and an implied multiple from its last round.

22
00:01:41,078 --> 00:01:43,161
Then, one approval.

23
00:01:43,161 --> 00:01:52,887
The isolated issuer creates the share register on our zero-gas BlockID chain: an identity registry, KYC for every holder, and the shares themselves.

24
00:01:52,887 --> 00:01:58,291
It then mirrors the register, with a Merkle root, to Ethereum Hoodi and HashKey Chain.

25
00:01:58,291 --> 00:02:04,189
The founder watches every step live, and shareholders add the token to MetaMask on any chain.

26
00:02:05,662 --> 00:02:07,615
You don't have to trust us.

27
00:02:07,615 --> 00:02:15,440
The verify page recomputes the valuation report hash right in your browser, and compares it with the hash anchored on all three chains.

28
00:02:15,440 --> 00:02:17,081
No login needed.

29
00:02:17,081 --> 00:02:20,089
Change a single score, and it turns red.

30
00:02:21,558 --> 00:02:33,081
This is live today: twelve real companies, thirty-six token contracts on three chains, and eighty-seven billion Australian dollars of indicative valuation on-chain, with every hash verified.

31
00:02:33,081 --> 00:02:42,378
Our full demo run took Canva from its website to a share register on three chains, a new round, a dividend and a shareholder transfer, in eleven minutes.

32
00:02:42,378 --> 00:02:45,281
Try it at eth dot blockid dot a u.

33
00:02:45,281 --> 00:02:48,758
We're looking for pilot startups and licensed partners.

34
00:02:48,758 --> 00:02:49,878
Thank you.
